      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SURGE (3) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a sensational early split last time, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten 3.5 lengths at this track over 515m in 29.76. The form out of last race has been strong. Rates highly and will give a great sight. CROYDON (1) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at 10 of 44 starts including 23 wins but missed the frame latest when fourth (29.64) over 515m at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 10 races. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. WARREN'S LEDGER (8) finished sixth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his dynamic 25.08 win at Warrnambool over 450m. Expected to feature on best figures. WEBLEC JOEL (2) can feature with the right run.",
